guarantee: AC-1: final_finished outcome=failed writes reason=<FailReason> (contract body)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/diag/format.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
                    pair(out, "outcome", "failed");
                    pair(out, "reason", fail_reason(*reason));
